<title>INDIA: Indian Aug nitrogenous fertiliser output rises.</title>
<headline>Indian Aug nitrogenous fertiliser output rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's production of nitrogenous fertiliser rose in August compared with the same month last year, the government said on Monday.</p>
<p>    PRODUCTION	Aug 96   Aug 95	   Apr-Aug</p>
<p>						     1996	1995</p>
<p>    Nitrogenous     790.8    740.8     3,201.5   3,466.6</p>
<p>    Phosphatic	229.7    232.2	 921.8   1,042.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are in thousands of tonnes.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
